                    {
                        "sense_id": "461cd875-d9fa-3c4d-8f5c-a1ddd62c2540",
                        "entry_id": "8fd7c8db-eb46-36d6-b6bd-ab321c4470ea",
                        "glosses": [
                            "iemand die beroepsmatig anderen vervoert in een auto"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "beroep"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea823db6-beee-431e-8a50-ad048dcd7988",
                                "sense_id": "461cd875-d9fa-3c4d-8f5c-a1ddd62c2540",
                                "text": "De taxichauffeur kwam gelukkig op tijd om nog de vlucht te kunnen halen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "511c60aa-eab0-4e95-b5fc-36a5621d70de",
                                "sense_id": "461cd875-d9fa-3c4d-8f5c-a1ddd62c2540",
                                "text": "De eerste die ik sinds lange tijd sprak, afgezien van de weinige afgemeten woorden die ik aan het begin en het einde van de rit had gewisseld met mijn norse taxichauffeur, was een magere, donkere jongen in het nostalgische rode uniform van een piccolo."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "39e803de-9283-4f0e-add1-ff05d18ab736",
                        "source_entry_id": "8fd7c8db-eb46-36d6-b6bd-ab321c4470ea",
                        "source_sense_id": "461cd875-d9fa-3c4d-8f5c-a1ddd62c2540",
                        "target_lang_word": "taxi-driver",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "taxi-driver",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f3b0f076-d0e1-34f1-8390-7b13e70d4940",
                                        "entry_id": "4caa84ab-318c-3aa4-b51b-305bb287bed4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of taxi driver."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89b29afd-ed77-405a-a4b6-c83a45cbf23f",
                                                "sense_id": "f3b0f076-d0e1-34f1-8390-7b13e70d4940",
                                                "text": "The difficulty of snuff in its return to the drawing-room is its popularity in the street—you remember the lady who put fur capes out of fashion by clothing her coachman and footman in them. It was on a Sunday morning that an observer saw the flower-girls around the Royal Exchange accepting a pinch of snuff from the taxi-driver."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26b97eba-b95d-4208-9b94-fb1d8b6a66a3",
                                                "sense_id": "f3b0f076-d0e1-34f1-8390-7b13e70d4940",
                                                "text": "“We need to hear from anyone who may have dash-cam footage, including taxi-drivers who were in the area of Long Row West and Angel Row at the time, or any mobile phone footage of the incident.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1eef7ee-3cca-4eb4-ab6c-469f2d66e432",
                                                "sense_id": "f3b0f076-d0e1-34f1-8390-7b13e70d4940",
                                                "text": "As city centre taxi-drivers based at Leeds railway station, they had very few passengers yesterday due to the train strike and took a break in the park."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8f74b5c4-91f8-4756-9dfd-bc2e739a1c9f",
                        "source_entry_id": "8fd7c8db-eb46-36d6-b6bd-ab321c4470ea",
                        "source_sense_id": "461cd875-d9fa-3c4d-8f5c-a1ddd62c2540",
                        "target_lang_word": "taxidriver",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "taxidriver",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b802c495-14d8-3b82-9f9a-f639ff22d2c3",
                                        "entry_id": "4e1c61de-24f3-3383-b409-6cbec9a01474",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of taxi driver."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "30ca1146-4bd8-441a-a04f-fe10453d9a8e",
                                                "sense_id": "b802c495-14d8-3b82-9f9a-f639ff22d2c3",
                                                "text": "Then you become the real taxidriver who understands just one sign of the whole sign language – it’s the one that yells I WANNA TAXI! TAXI! STOP! […] A taxidriver like that learns to get to know one gesture only but every form of it: The uppity-mellow lifting of the left arm of little Madison Avenue ladies whose right hand is holding a leash with a choking lap-sized dog; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1075f907-44a7-4466-b820-66800abb1440",
                                                "sense_id": "b802c495-14d8-3b82-9f9a-f639ff22d2c3",
                                                "text": "When I was your age, we didn’t have gyms. Or, there were a few. But they were for—boxers, taxidrivers. Men, anyway."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "363302e8-2ec6-457f-8c50-c8ae3087715f",
                                                "sense_id": "b802c495-14d8-3b82-9f9a-f639ff22d2c3",
                                                "text": "Pickets came and went for the shortest shifts before resuming their work as teachers, taxidrivers or minders of other newspapers’ machinery."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "00627732-8acb-4e2c-8639-862f140a0b93",
                        "source_entry_id": "8fd7c8db-eb46-36d6-b6bd-ab321c4470ea",
                        "source_sense_id": "461cd875-d9fa-3c4d-8f5c-a1ddd62c2540",
